  "description": "Frick Frack is a puzzle simulation game about hurting what you love the most. You play as a miner digging wells for a fracking company. You must find the perfect work-life balance but the work you do directly affects the world around you. Good luck.\n\nFrack\n- Dig tunnels, extract oil, get money\n\nSpend\n- Use your fracking money to buy essentials, or more\n\nRepeat.CreditsWeston Bell-Geddes | Director, Developer, Designer, Engineer, Writer\n\nErica Wang | Artist\nSheehan Ahmed | Engineer\nDoug Walters | Sound Designer, Composer",
  "description_short": "Just as you were about to lose all hope, you’ve found a job. It’s not exactly what you dreamed, but it pays the bills. You begin work and quickly learn the consequences of your actions.",
